# NOTE: tests/ is deliberately kept in the context: every E2E image is built from
# the repository root and every Dockerfile lives under tests/e2e. Besides
# metadata.lua, hooks and lib, the Windows image copies
# tests/e2e/windows/bootstrap-tools.ps1, and the Linux one the mirror stand-in
# in tests/e2e/linux/mirror.
